D Simulator · biomolecules\"","\u0027Sin NAD⁺ la glucólisis se detendría.\u0027":"\"Without NAD⁺ glycolysis would stop.\"","\u0027Sin O₂\u0027":"\"No O₂\"","\u0027Sin O₂ la cadena se detiene: la glucólisis regenera NAD⁺ con \u003cb\u003elactato\u003c/b\u003e.\u0027":"\"Without O₂ the chain stops: glycolysis regenerates NAD⁺ with \u003cb\u003elactate\u003c/b\u003e.\"","\u0027Sin O₂, el piruvato se reduce a lactato para…\u0027":"\"Without O₂, pyruvate is reduced to lactate in order to…\"","\u0027Succinato\u0027":"\"Succinate\"","\u0027succinato DH (+FADH₂)\u0027":"\"succinate DH (+FADH₂)\"","\u0027Succinil-CoA\u0027":"\"Succinyl-CoA\"","\u0027succinil-CoA sintetasa (+GTP)\u0027":"\"succinyl-CoA synthetase (+GTP)\"","\u0027Superior\u0027":"\"Top\"","\u0027Torre redox de la cadena respiratoria\u0027":"\"Redox tower of the respiratory chain\"","\u0027Total aerobio\u0027":"\"Aerobic total\"","\u0027Total disponible: 2 870 kJ/mol de glucosa\u0027":"\"Total available: 2,870 kJ/mol of glucose\"","\u0027Transporta H⁺ por la membrana; la cadena trabaja a tope y la energía se libera como calor.\u0027":"\"It carries H⁺ across the membrane; the chain works at full speed and the energy is released as heat.\"","\u0027Un \u003cb\u003edesacoplante\u003c/b\u003e (DNP) disipa Δp: consumo de O₂ ↑, ATP ↓, calor ↑.\u0027":"\"An \u003cb\u003euncoupler\u003c/b\u003e (DNP) dissipates Δp: O₂ consumption ↑, ATP ↓, heat ↑.\"","\u0027Un desacoplante como el DNP…\u0027":"\"An uncoupler such as DNP…\"","\u0027Usa «Lab» para elegir la etapa, el inhibidor y la presencia de O₂.\u0027":"\"Use “Lab” to choose the stage, the inhibitor and the presence of O₂.\"","\u0027Visión general\u0027":"\"Overview\"","\u0027Volver a la lección\u0027":"\"Back to the lesson\"","\u0027α-Cetoglutarato\u0027":"\"α-Ketoglutarate\"","\u0027α-CG DH (−CO₂, +NADH)\u0027":"\"α-KG DH (−CO₂, +NADH)\"","\u0027ΔE = 1,14 V → ΔG°′ = −nFΔE = −220 kJ/mol\u0027":"\"ΔE = 1.14 V → ΔG°′ = −nFΔE = −220 kJ/mol\"","\u0027ΔG = −nFΔE; de NADH 